@startuml coupon-use-activity
title 订单结算使用优惠券

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #94A3B8
  DiamondBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
  DiamondBorderColor #3B82F6
  StartColor #16A34A
  EndColor #EF4444
  ArrowColor #475569
}
skinparam swimlane {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  TitleBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
}

|用户|

start

:结算下单\n携带所选用户券;

|优惠券服务|

:试算;

:锁券;

|数据库|

:锁定用户券;

|用户|

:订单待支付;

|优惠券服务|

if (支付成功?) then (是)
  :核销;
else (否)
  :释放或回退;
endif

stop

@enduml
